# fixedbugs, defect 2357, lane b25-pkgc, 2026-11-08.
#
# A program holding a fetched package's group record by value: its unit
# spells the record's C type, so it includes the header the package's group
# names, and after defect 2351 only the package's own unit searched the
# package's folder, so the program was refused `ffi_missing_header` at the
# package's line unless `--include` named that folder. Now a unit reaching
# another package's record searches that package's folder after its own
# route (the coordinator's ruling): this module's unit and the one of
# `geo/shape` each read `pt.h` from `pt`'s folder.
use <pt>/pt

use geo/shape

function main()
    p: pt.Point = pt.make(x: 3, y: 4)
    print(p.x + p.y)
    print(shape.sum())
